#N canvas 40 40 1000 700 12;
#X text 20 5 PreSonus ATOM SQ MIDI map \, native mode. DRAFT - numbers are from reverse-engineered sources \, not yet checked on the hardware. select only the SQ in Media > MIDI Settings: everything here listens on all channels and ports because sources disagree on the pad channel \, and the DDJ-200 would collide. sends: sq-* use [r sq-play] etc downstream. encoders and dial send signed deltas. sq-pad = note velocity;
