#X text 640 490 native mode (8F 00 7F) and display setup \, then the PULSAR splash (atom-sq-glitch) \, then display on (same order as the Bitwig extension). after the 3 s splash sq-ready starts the screen \, pad display and synth readout. if the display stays blank try the other SQ port for MIDI out \, or 143 0 1. send sq-init after replugging;
